// Fleet memory triage log. One JSON object per line, append only.
// A DECISION clears a scratch file from the backlog. Declining is a valid decision and is
// the honest outcome for most Tier 2 lessons; a gate that only accepted promotion would
// push the planner to promote weak lessons to clear a number, which is exactly the drift
// the planner-gated firewall exists to prevent.
// Schema:
//   {"date":"YYYY-MM-DD","scratchFile":"<name>.md","decision":"promoted|declined",
//    "form":"guard|prose|none","ref":"<test path or MEMORY.md row id>","reason":"..."}
// Read by scripts/enforcement/memory-promotion-gate.mjs. Empty is a legitimate state: it
// means no triage has happened yet, which was true from the practice being written until
// 2026-08-20.
